{
  "description": "Download the official PACE 2021 heuristic archive, select exactly the 100 odd-numbered public instances, and recreate the frozen XZ outputs with XZ Utils 5.8.4 in a pinned Docker builder. Every compressed output is checked against the retained manifest; no manually prepared source archive is required.",
